# ADR-007 §5/Worse: CoIR corpora + queries are regenerated on demand from the HF
# cache (tools/coir_prepare.py), not committed — some are large (codefeedback-mt
# corpus ~103 MB, its queries ~60 MB). The committed deliverable is baseline.jsonl;
# qrels.tsv (small gold-label files) ARE committed to pin what grading ran against.
coir/*/corpus.jsonl
coir/*/queries.jsonl

# Cached corpus embeddings (resume/checkpoint shards) — derived, never committed.
coir/*/_emb/
*.faiss

# Run logs — derived, never committed (the baseline.jsonl record is the deliverable).
*.log
